    <string name="problem_statement_title">The Problem</string>
    <string name="problem_statement_text">There is often a transparency gap in rural infrastructure. Citizens are usually unaware of local works progress, leading to a lack of community ownership. Grama-Suvidha aims to visualize \"Digital Progress\" for village-level assets.</string>
